# scripts/opcount (go run ./scripts/opcount -control examples/stackvm/testdata/fib):
# `stackvm fib N` sums fib(15) by recursion N times, on vm.Exec's call
# loop; the cost of one round is the slope between the two sizes.
unit round
sizes 20 120
args fib {n}
control examples/stackvm/testdata/control
floor examples/stackvm/testdata/floor
